android: A5 — floating-point Parse<T> without std::from_chars

NDK r27 libc++ marks floating-point std::from_chars deleted. Route
Parse<float>/Parse<double> through strtof/strtod with matching semantics
(nullopt on no-conversion/range, trailing garbage tolerated).

---
diff --git a/src/Utils/Parsers.h b/src/Utils/Parsers.h
index 244cb1a..f90173d 100644
--- a/src/Utils/Parsers.h
+++ b/src/Utils/Parsers.h
@@ -3,20 +3,68 @@
